==============================================================================
Sample documents
==============================================================================

Studio "Try the example case" documents (see
web/casepatch_studio/sample/ATTRIBUTION.md):

  * 01_card_statement.pdf — Consumer Financial Protection Bureau,
    "Building Blocks" sample credit card statement (consumerfinance.gov).
    United States federal government work, public domain.

  * 02_receipt_photo.jpg — CORD v2 receipt dataset, test split row 88,
    Park et al., "CORD: A Consolidated Receipt Dataset for Post-OCR
    Parsing" (naver-clova-ix/cord-v2). Licensed under Creative Commons
    Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

  * 03_id_card_photo.jpg — MIDV-500 mobile identity document video
    dataset, Albanian ID specimen, Arlazarov et al. (2019); frame via
    the Noaman/midv500 Hugging Face mirror. Licensed under Creative
    Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 2.5 Generic (CC BY-SA 2.5),
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.5/.

    This file is redistributed unmodified. Transformed outputs you make
    from it are adaptations and must be shared under CC BY-SA 2.5.

Landing-page and demo comparison images derived from the same sources
are documented in web/landing/assets/LICENSES.md and
web/demo/cases/compare/ATTRIBUTION.md. Images derived from the MIDV-500
ID specimen are also licensed under CC BY-SA 2.5.

Other public-domain sample citations (United States government works
and Wikimedia Commons official specimens) are documented in those
attribution files and in examples/real/SOURCES.md. Research-only
datasets (including FUNSD and SROIE) are not included in this
repository.

